+ * retention). A prompt to one reaches Venice readable, is answered and forgotten; it is not
+ * end to end encrypted. The owner may trust this tier for her ([LLMConfig.trustVenicePrivate]):
+ * then a call to such a model counts as a private route ([RoutePrivacy.PRIVATE_TIER]),
+ * nothing about him is held back from it, and his ENCRYPTED setting lets her replies and her
