+
+    /**
+     * Everything the app keeps about her own time. [on] says the app has seen it
+     * switched on, so that it can tell the moment it is switched on again. [moments] are
+     * the times of her moments in the last day, oldest first. [lastGapMillis] is the
+     * last gap she chose herself, 0 when she has chosen none. [moved] with [movedAsked]
+     * is what she is told at her next moment about a wish that was moved. [failures]
+     * counts the attempts at the moment that is due which failed one after another.
+     *
+     * The rest is her sleep ([PersonaSleep]). [asleepSince] is 0 while she is awake;
+     * otherwise it is when she lay down, which also tells one sleep from the next. She
+     * means to wake at [sleepUntil], [sleepMeantMillis] after she lay down as the app
+     * took what she asked for ([sleepAsked], moved as [sleepMoved] says). A sleep pass is
+     * due at [repairDueAt] (0 for none), has been tried [repairTries] times in this
+     * sleep, and is [repairOwed] when one did not come about. [repairMissed] counts the
+     * sleeps in a row whose pass was tried and did not come about. [lastRepairOkAt] is when
+     * the last pass came about, and [lastRepair] what the last one came to, in counts.
