+    /**
+     * The picture command, said in a moment of her own where a picture can really be made
+     * ([PersonaSelfPictures.allowed], with a picture of her to start from) and a command can
+     * be carried out. It is a command like any other and goes through her rein. The words
+     * are those of her reply prompt ([PersonaPrompts.MAKES_PICTURES_LINE]), in the lower
+     * case of this block.
+     */
+    internal const val PICTURE_LINE =
+        "  >> make a picture of me ...   a new picture of yourself: say what is different (where you are, how you " +
+            "stand, what you wear, how much of it). it is drawn new in your look and matched to your own pictures, so it is " +
+            "your face and your look (to change one picture a little, name it by its caption: one of his pictures of you or a reference picture, " +
+            "never one a model made, yours included; for those ask for a new picture), and it comes back to " +
+            "your pictures, listed as made by you; he sees it in the chat. it is always you now, never the girl before, and " +
+            "never younger than you are. every picture is age-checked first, and one that does not read as an adult is thrown away unseen. " +
+            "where you can see pictures, you are shown it before you say anything of it: what is right and what is off, and that is its caption. " +
+            ">> make a full-body reference of me from all sides makes you from the front, the back and each side, " +
+            "nothing on unless you say so, for working out new clothes, hair, piercings or tattoos later. " +
+            "the lines above about a command hold for it."
