+            append("      go: look [back | front | around]                      one look through the phone's camera: back faces away from him, front faces him, around is one of each.")
+        } else {
+            append("      go: look back                                         one look through the phone's back camera, which faces away from him; his settings keep the front one off.")
+        }
+        append(" only while his screen is on and unlocked: android shows its camera light")
+        append(if (camera.tellsHim) ", and the app tells him each time. " else ". ")
+        if (asks) append("his settings ask him first, as for an outing. ")
+        if (camera.ownEyes) {
+            append("you see the picture yourself in a moment of looking right after, once the app has checked it for kids; it is not kept. ")
+        } else {
+            append("a describer that is not you looks at the picture, and you get its words in a moment of looking right after; the picture is not kept. ")
+        }
+        if (camera.foldable) {
