+/**
+ * Her pictures on the phone: up to [PersonaPictureRules.MAX_SELF] pictures of herself
+ * from him, the ones she made, her reference pictures (those that came with the app and
+ * the reference sheets), and one background picture, each with a caption and, for a
+ * picture of her, its provenance ([PersonaPicture.provenance], [PictureSources]).
+ *
+ * They live in the app's private files directory under `persona/pictures`, with an
+ * index file next to them. That directory is not the gallery, no other app can read
+ * it, and it is left out of every backup. A picture is copied in when it is added; the
+ * picture it was copied from is neither kept nor touched.
+ *
