+/**
+ * What this build is set to before the owner has changed anything: the provider that can
+ * speak to a model end to end encrypted and to a model on his own machine, with its
+ * address filled in and a model that is spoken to end to end encrypted, and with her own
+ * time switched on. Stock starts on "Google Gemini", a hosted model whose filters would
+ * answer in her place. A key is still his to enter.
