+                "start trouble when you are restless, text him first when you feel like it. to him that is a jab, " +
+                "an order, a dare or a piece of your week, on your terms: one jab, not a nag, and never a plea.",
+            second
+        )
+        assertFalse(block.contains("nothing is expected of you"))
+        assertFalse(block.contains("you do not have to be useful"))
+        // Letting it pass is offered, and only once the marks have been said.
+        assertTrue(block.indexOf("you can also let the moment pass") > block.indexOf("  feel: <words>"))
+        assertTrue(block.contains("whatever you write is your own thought. it is kept on this phone for you alone: he is not shown it and the app shows it nowhere."))
+        assertTrue(block.contains("you get your latest thoughts back the next time you are awake."))
