+    //
+    // Changed with the masters (the owner's decision): a picture of her he adds is an original,
+    // and originals are kept as he gave them, never decoded and written again or scaled. The
+    // background picture is copied in scaled down as JPEG, as every picture was before.
+
+    @Test
+    fun `a picture of her he adds is kept as he gave it, byte for byte, as an original, and the one he picked is left alone`() {
+        val uri = picked(2048, 1536)
+        val original = File(uri.path!!)
+        val originalBytes = original.readBytes()
+
+        val picture = add(uri)
+
